PASS V5 Primary text: passages render whole with speaker, place and rights; SHOW SOURCE opens the quotation record (exact words, rights, misattribution risk, how it was checked); synthesised listening plays; dialogue renders
PASS V6 Each season-3 session completes when it is the one left, and works that the session teaches appear in its receipt with a rung of the possession ladder
